# Testing

## Pre-push (required)

```bash
cd server && npx jest --env=node --forceExit
cd flutter_app && dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs
cd flutter_app && flutter analyze --no-fatal-warnings --no-fatal-infos
cd flutter_app && flutter test --concurrency=1 --exclude-tags=integration
node scripts/check_file_size.js
node e2e/scripts/check_bdd_coverage.js
```

## Layer expectations

| Layer | Tool | Rule |
|---|---|---|
| Node routes | Jest + supertest | Every route module gets a test file |
| Dart routes | `dart analyze lib` | Same PR as Node when HTTP behaviour changes |
| Flutter domain/data | `flutter test` | Models, repos, datasources |
| Flutter UI | Widget tests | Extracted widgets + critical screens |
| Integration | `flutter test` integration dir | **Blocking in CI** — no `continue-on-error` |
| Journeys | Playwright (`e2e/`) | UAT gate only; annotate `@bdd` + `@smoke` for critical paths |

## BDD (hybrid — no Cucumber runner)

- Gherkin specs: `flutter_app/test/bdd/features/`
- Playwright implementations: `e2e/playwright/tests/` with `/** @bdd <feature> */` comment
- New user journey → add Gherkin scenario **and** Playwright spec (or link debt issue)

## Coverage

- Add tests before or during extraction, not after.
- New route → Jest; new widget → widget test in mirrored path.
- BDD: keep `@bdd` header titles **exact** match to Gherkin `Scenario:` lines.
- Pre-push: `node scripts/check_file_size.js` and `node e2e/scripts/check_bdd_coverage.js`.
